WEBVTT

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:18.550
The power of the Akuruka is finally mine!

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:23.680
Now you are nothing less than the de facto ruler of Yamato!

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.060
Time to try it on!

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.430
Don't just stand there like a fool! Help me!

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.320
Yes, right away.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.450
Excuse me.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:41.590
Ouch!

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.020
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.900
There's a gap on the forehead.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.330
Just a little more... Whoops!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.620
The mask fell!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:46.790
Why not cooperate and just confess to your crimes, General?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.210
You leave us no choice.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.040
If you insist on remaining silent,

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.850
we will be forced to continue our whipping.

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:02.340
Prepare yourself.

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:10.810
V-Vurai-sama!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.210
General Vurai...

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.980
So this is the end of the man I recognized as my equal.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.610
How fares the princess?

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:44.650
Even now, you are concerned about the princess?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.240
Do you still not understand?

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.470
The Emperor has passed,

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.500
and the Eight Pillar Generals are already

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.550
starting to suspect one another of plotting for power.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.940
You were too close to the princess.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:05.490
You have been set up by people who distrust your loyalty.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.990
Your troops stand outside, charging the palace.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:13.630
And those in the city who believe in your innocence

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.750
are but a hair's breadth from rioting.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:22.810
Perhaps Yamato's course was set the moment it lost its emperor{no caps needed here}.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:24.820
Be that as it may...

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.510
I will <i>not</i> suffer this folly.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:31.020
Any who bring disorder to Yamato are an enemy of the Emperor.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:35.270
They shall all be slain along with their families.{hi trump}

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.000
However...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.040
If you admit to your crimes and offer yourself to the executioner...

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:46.820
Oshutoru, General of the Right...

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:51.120
Die, so that Yamato shall live.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:56.360
Oshutoru chose to die?

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.620
What about the princess?

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:06.690
She's survived, it seems.

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.140
I cannot accept this injustice.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:10.800
Why must Oshutoru offer his life?

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.200
That's right.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.190
He didn't do anything wrong!

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:17.640
He's sacrificing himself for the sake of the people.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.810
How very like him.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.170
Nekone...

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:24.710
What should we do, Haku?

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:27.580
If we're going to help, there's no time to waste.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.930
His sentence is to be carried out at sunset today.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.070
We have to hurry.

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:32.880
Right...

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:35.580
But what we do after saving him is the hard part.

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:38.830
It goes without saying that they'll give chase.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.600
It won't be an easy escape, huh?

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.080
Let's go to Ennakamui.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:49.590
Ennakamui?

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:50.800
Yes.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.590
Ennakamui is our homeland.

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:55.100
We'll surely be safe there.

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:57.060
You sure 'bout that?

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.080
Might be your homeland and all,

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:04.860
but he'll be on the run, suspected of tryin' to assassinate the good princess, y'know.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.520
Leave it to me.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.110
I'll go there first and persuade them.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:12.490
Pretty rare to hear you say something cool, kid.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:16.490
H-Hey! I'm cool sometimes!

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.030
Take Shinonon with you.

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:29.510
Can't exactly let you face the danger alone, yeah?

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.240
Yakutowaruto?

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.500
No! I wanna go with Daddy!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.510
I don't wanna go with Kiuru!{rekt}

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:39.020
N-No... Er... Uh...

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.520
Shinonon...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.900
Okay, we'll leave at once.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:47.780
Let's go.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:58.110
Kiuru! If you don't hurry, I'll leave you behind!

00:06:58.890 --> 00:06:59.640
Goodbye.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.170
I'm counting on you.

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:05.540
Atui and Rurutie, get back to the palace.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:07.550
The palace?

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:10.550
What I'm about to do is a crime.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.800
You two are princesses of entire nations.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.810
I can't get you involved.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.880
Mister, don't say that.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:21.640
Let us do somethin'.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:22.590
No.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:24.060
Aw, but...

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.410
It's okay.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.310
Leave this to us.

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:31.070
We'll contact you once we get to Ennakamui.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.570
Kuon-han...

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.150
Atui-sama, let's go.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.080
Ain't got a choice, huh?

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.580
Let's get this thing started, yeah?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:47.610
Yeah.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.790
I understand that you want to respect how Oshutoru feels,

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.670
but that's exactly why he has to survive.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:01.600
You know better than anyone how much he cares for the people.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:07.000
I think that at a time like this, he's just what Yamato needs.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.720
There are things that can only be accomplished if he's alive.

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:12.410
Haku-san...

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:14.700
Right.

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:19.620
Take this to Oshutoru's men.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:23.400
Tell them not to do anything rash.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.110
Leave it to me.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.090
Okay everyone, let's go.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.380
We're rescuing Oshutoru and the princess.

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.130
The princess, too?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:37.810
I doubt whoever tried to poison her would give up just like that.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:41.680
Nekone and I will go to save Oshutoru.

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.270
Kuon and Yakutowaruto, take care of Anju.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.310
Leave it to me, yeah?

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:48.170
Nosuri, you get us a ship.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.260
We'll meet at the warehouse district in the east.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.400
Consider it done!

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:56.530
Uruuru, Saraana, can you get us inside the palace?

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:57.480
No.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:01.030
Someone has erected a powerful barrier.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:03.390
We cannot act.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:05.790
If we do, they'll notice us.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.430
So what's your plan now?

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:09.620
Bust in the front door?

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:14.510
Haku?

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:16.550
Bathroom break.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.800
Oh, o-okay.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.560
Might we be having some trouble?

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:28.720
Karura...

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:31.840
If you require, I can provide assistance.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.950
I've found a way into the palace!

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.450
We'll take the sewers.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.990
I had no idea there was such a way in.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.550
Where did you get this?

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.650
It's going to get a lot quieter here after today.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:07.340
Mothe—

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.730
S-Sister...

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.600
Be on your way.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.670
And don't eat too much.{rood}

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.470
Um...

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:46.190
Here?

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:54.480
A hidden door?

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.350
Out of the gutter and into the sewer, huh?

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:14.380
So you extracted a confession from him in exchange for the people's lives?

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.250
That was the plan from the start.

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:23.760
Dekoponpo-sama, at this rate, Vurai will take over Yamato!

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.780
Don't fret.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:29.020
We can act after Oshutoru is dead.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:37.900
It is not the place of the powerless to speak of justice and ideals.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:41.280
Might alone makes right.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:45.190
With the great Emperor dead,

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:50.630
Yamato must be ruled by one with absolute power!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.270
This will be the last road he ever walks.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:08.470
Let's decorate it appropriately.

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:08.930
Yes, sir!

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:14.470
I can't wait to see the look on Oshutoru's face when his head is parted from his body!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.830
Atui-sama, calm down a bit.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.830
But the time...

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.880
That's true, but...

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:43.740
So after all his shows of loyalty, he tried to poison her?

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.930
Oshutoru finally showed his true colors.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:50.430
I always thought he was suspicious.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:51.680
You said it.

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:55.390
I told them we couldn't trust an outsider.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:12:59.690
Let's go.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:15.680
Just a bit cheaper!{lit. "Cheaper!". It's used when they're asking for more discount}

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:18.460
I don't know, miss...

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.060
Anju's bedroom is up those stairs.

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:27.980
We won't be able to get there easily.

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:28.970
Leave it to me.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:40.080
Well done.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.320
Intruder!

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:52.700
Not bad yourself.

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:54.200
Let's hurry.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:07.010
We've come to save the 
Imperial Princess at the order of

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:09.200
the princesses of Kujuuri and Shahhoro.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.470
Please enter.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.570
Excuse us.

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:20.980
Anju!

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.390
I don't know what she was poisoned with.

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:26.060
She's been like this ever since...

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:28.160
May I approach her?

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.990
I don't know how well this will work, but...

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:47.000
Here.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.310
Haku-sama isn't with you?

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:00.660
He's gone to save Oshutoru.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:02.640
I see.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:09.530
Please take care of Anju in my stead.

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:14.070
I will. I promise.

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:15.080
Excuse me.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:44.310
A fine gleam.

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:50.820
We're all countin' on you, mister.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:58.580
Who goes there?

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:01.700
Halt!

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:02.960
Intruder!

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:10.300
Nekone!

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:11.550
The key!

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:12.800
I know!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:19.020
Oshutoru-sama!

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:22.000
We're here to save you, Oshutoru!

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:23.810
Master Haku...

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:28.060
Oshutoru-sama, your body...{She said "body", not "back". not sure where that came from. You can see lots of marks all over his body on the next part too}

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.990
It is nothing.

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.840
More importantly, what of the city?

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:35.240
Bad news there, I'm afraid.

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:38.570
It's on the verge of civil war.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:40.580
I see.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.390
Anyway, there's no time.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.080
We need to get out of here.

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:46.330
Get out of here?

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.830
For now, we'll hide in Ennakamui.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:52.230
We'll wait for things to cool off there.

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:56.330
I've sent Kiuru there to persuade them to let us stay.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:02.150
We've told your imperial guards the plan,

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:04.850
and Big Sister's gone to save the princess.

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:06.990
Don't die for nothing in a place like this.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:08.100
We're leaving!

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:10.790
I cannot.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.170
You can't? Why not?

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:16.860
Because Yamato must live.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:20.310
Yamato must... live?

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:23.370
Hushed whispers of plots and motives flit about this palace.{orig: The palace is filled with intrigue and plots.}{that's what it says, maybe a bit too fancily but it fits the scene I guess}

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:28.150
Even if the matter of the 
princess's poisoning is resolved,

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.990
the power struggle will continue.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:35.430
The Eight Pillar Generals will all begin plotting against one another.

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:40.060
And if they do, it will be naught but the people who will suffer.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:45.640
I have entrusted the future of the imperial capital to Vurai.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:51.650
His loyalty to the Emperor is without equal.

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:57.150
He will maintain the Emperor's glory and lead the people of Yamato.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:02.250
To that end, my life is insignificant.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:06.790
That's not true!

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:13.560
It's true that Vurai may have been loyal to the Emperor,

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.820
but what he did in Uzuurussha...

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.910
I believe that you,

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:30.520
Oshutoru, are the only one who can bring true happiness to the people.

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:34.460
You're the only one who can speak to the people and build a nation

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.820
that exists for their benefit!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:38.400
Brother...

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.270
It has already been decided.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:44.410
Oshutoru!

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:49.930
They're late!

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:50.760
Nosuri!

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:51.920
They're here?

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:53.990
You're late!

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:55.200
Sorry about that.

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:57.820
Where's Haku?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:58.810
Not here yet.

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.580
What? <i>Still</i>?

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:14.190
The sun...

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:16.040
...has set.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.490
Bring Oshutoru.

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:20.270
Yes, sir!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.270
Did he screw up?

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.080
Haku...

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:33.580
Oshutoru!

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.370
Leave me be.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:38.090
Master Haku, you must leave.

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:51.310
Then I'm staying, too.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:51.980
Master Haku!

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:54.350
Nekone!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.120
Ruru-yan!

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:02.610
Haku-sama...

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:25.510
Is this...

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:34.130
It's the end for him.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.920
Oshutoru has escaped!

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.420
It stopped.

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:52.040
Sorry about the wait.

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:56.040
Haku!

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:58.690
Curse you, Oshutoru!

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:01.050
Find him and bring him back!

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:09.700
You're late!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:10.910
Don't blame me.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.430
The guy's pretty stubborn.

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:15.680
I almost got killed myself.

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:19.940
You did not intend to share my fate?

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.090
Of course not.

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:24.370
I just said that because I didn't have a choice.

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:25.950
Whew, that was scary.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:29.560
Really? I was sure...

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:31.200
How's the princess?

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:32.820
Her fever's down.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:34.320
Nothing to worry about now.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:36.960
Guess you can have your merry reunion later.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:38.660
Our vessel awaits over there.

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:43.210
Fugitives sighted!

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:51.100
Leave this merry bunch to me, 'kay?

00:21:55.860 --> 00:21:56.600
Daddy!
